        <briefdescription>
<para>Map a latency delta to a confidence score in [0.0, 1.0]. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>confidence = sigmoid(|delta_p99_ms| / sensitivity_ms)</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
