    <briefdescription>
<para>Auto-labeler for database-domain LoRA training samples. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stateless helper class (all methods are <computeroutput>const</computeroutput>). Instantiation is cheap; the same instance may be shared across threads.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_database_domain_auto_labeler_1a393efedf2d211e80325a21f28c70b898" kindref="member">DatabaseDomainAutoLabeler</ref><sp/>labeler;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>sample<sp/>=<sp/>labeler.<ref refid="class_database_domain_auto_labeler_1af5b034f82ba014ce2c63020d5dc6e10c" kindref="member">labelFromBaoDecision</ref>(query,<sp/>plan_json,<sp/>-15.0);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>sample.confidence<sp/>≈<sp/>0.82,<sp/>sample.label<sp/>==<sp/>DomainType::DATABASE_OPTIMIZER</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
